{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33939","headline":"病中庭际海石榴花盛发感而有寄 · 皮日休","name":"病中庭际海石榴花盛发感而有寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一夜春光绽绦囊，碧油枝上昼煌煌。\n风匀秖似调红露，日暖唯忧化赤霜。\n火齐满枝烧夜月，金津含蘂滴朝阳。\n不知桂树知情否，无限同游阻陆郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33939.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33939","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}